        "type": "writing",
        "title": "In their advertising, businesses nowadays usually emphasise that their products are new in some way. Why is this? Do you think it is a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XlX3d1Cjio8SDyxXmOLlXoVhgjh\"><em><strong>In their advertising, businesses nowadays usually emphasise that their products are new in some way. Why is this? Do you think it is a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Advertising New Products&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GdyRdbsZvoIxiwxeyISlrvrvgTq\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đề Advertising New Products&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Trong quảng c&aacute;o, c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp ng&agrave;y nay thường nhấn mạnh rằng sản phẩm của họ mới theo một c&aacute;ch n&agrave;o đ&oacute;.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYmHdZ0nfoX3qoxGqIql77xGgPc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi: </strong>Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp: <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">Tại sao? Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NarFdqPogo4bH7xugLPlA1OhgHg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Advertising New Products&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8zodPzrKoTPg3x1HthlzRkegPf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RwfrdnCBxoEeWexPUi3lImeEgYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UhkUdvTuRoLAwQx1PX2lYWSfg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwQ9dfi1xo7WIZxOEO5lO1qjgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GQWTdqqOYoZMAGx0PUClKqFSgHh\">promote products <em>(quảng b&aacute; sản phẩm</em>)</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VAmvdIMVioJ7lJxu3EXlhuA1gXe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-NQbpd82MYouqFbxAoV5lLEAOgrf\">advertising campaigns <em>(những chiến dịch quảng c&aacute;o)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zz5fdhBfuoSWEhxQmQolsQKJgHe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EB3zdgSE8oDcK3x9P4DlIpWAgZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EJYSd2mrtoZAxQxbBNIlB1qCgVg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đưa ra l&yacute; do tại sao c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp thường nhấn mạnh rằng sản phẩm của họ mới theo một c&aacute;ch n&agrave;o đ&oacute;.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bs65dcVGto8jMJxu4GslNZaIgah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Đưa ra lập luận cho rằng đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng ti&ecirc;u cực.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZeqHdZJfvoR6ikxE9sClk29bgvc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEQ0dwS7nowPZExW2i9l8z0vgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLymdBW54ogutCx2USClYflAgPf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ErfadJPNhoGippx8HFylh5IGgxe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=161\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFbjddKqRoA9AbxpHWPlVjUXgbe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=162\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PCV9deP2nouqvrxg8eUlsNuegXd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/185/writing-advanced-task-2?collection=lesson&amp;item=645\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J20Yds7vLoEOrrxK31XleiYqgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong><strong>B</strong><strong>&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp thường nhấn mạnh rằng sản phẩm của họ mới theo một c&aacute;ch n&agrave;o đ&oacute;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TvJGd3R4zoECjjxyRoOl2efgguc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>C&oacute; hai l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh khiến c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty <em>ch&uacute; trọng đến yếu tố đổi mới</em> (<em>highlight innovation</em>) trong <em>chiến lược tiếp thị </em>(<em>marketing strategies</em>) của họ.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WuQXdDl7CohvzVxCubTlYFHTgEf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SpzKdOg7oo2wYVxtP9wlUQuNgsc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea: </strong>họ hiểu rằng con người <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">vốn lu&ocirc;n khao kh&aacute;t những điều mới mẻ</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">naturally crave novelty</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">), thể hiện qua việc mọi người thường </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">muốn sở hữu những sản phẩm mới nhất</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">desire the latest items</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) v&agrave; </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">sợ bỏ lỡ c&aacute;c xu hướng hiện đại</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">fear missing out on new trends</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FxZcdWJdaoY94QxDcG8llrA3gOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Example: </strong>người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng lu&ocirc;n <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">h&aacute;o hức chờ đợi những mẫu điện thoại mới ra mắt</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">eagerly await new phone releases</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) h&agrave;ng năm, d&ugrave; những </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">thay đổi về t&iacute;nh năng chỉ l&agrave; nhỏ nhặt</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">minor changes in features</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7pHdjpkWoPWK8x2Ef7lD7DDgvd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LfsFd2CfYoDymyxTCc9l7J2zgZe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea</strong>: trong<em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> thị trường cạnh tranh</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">competitive marketplace</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) ng&agrave;y nay, khi nhiều c&ocirc;ng ty b&aacute;n những sản phẩm tương tự nhau, c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp buộc phải t&igrave;m c&aacute;ch </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">tạo sự kh&aacute;c biệt so với c&aacute;c đối thủ cạnh tranh</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">differentiate themselves from competitors</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NfYWdJq8coSt2AxycmLlBJX4gfh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>với nhiều lựa chọn tương đồng sẵn c&oacute; (<em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">similar choices available</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">), c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty thường </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">gắn m&aacute;c</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">label</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) \"mới v&agrave; cải tiến\" cho sản phẩm của m&igrave;nh để </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">nổi bật so với đối thủ</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">stand out from rivals</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ogajd9kkooYFT7xqNLelwX9Agah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PTcddY6Kqo7nHcxFb3UlpLsggud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Viết BODY 2: </strong><strong>Đưa </strong><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">ra lập luận cho rằng đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng ti&ecirc;u cực</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tz5cdshVeoUlfIxSjcZl6FyEgib\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Việc qu&aacute; đề cao yếu tố mới mẻ trong quảng c&aacute;o đ&atilde; dẫn đến những <em>hệ quả đ&aacute;ng lo ngại</em> (<em>concerning consequences</em>) về việc <em>quảng c&aacute;o g&acirc;y hiểu lầm</em> (<em>misleading advertising practices</em>) v&agrave; <em>th&oacute;i quen ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng qu&aacute; mức</em> (<em>excessive consumerism</em>).</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Td5MdogSfoAShexI1mll9SCLguh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KUHtdXeL9oZPyGxnuXWlE5LOgdd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea</strong>: nhiều quảng c&aacute;o thường&nbsp;<em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">ph&oacute;ng đại những cải tiến nhỏ</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">exaggerate minor improvements</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) th&agrave;nh </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">những đột ph&aacute; mang t&iacute;nh c&aacute;ch mạng</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">revolutionary breakthroughs</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">), chẳng hạn như quảng b&aacute; một \"</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, B