Symbol', serif;\">những th&ocirc;ng điệp quảng c&aacute;o</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">marketing claims</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GrS4diXbPoNdLwxyElOl1NRkgFf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RylydEM55oztrjxAvImlvxEDgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core idea</strong>: khi quảng c&aacute;o khiến mọi t&iacute;nh năng mới đều trở n&ecirc;n thiết yếu, người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng&nbsp;<em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">lu&ocirc;n cảm thấy &aacute;p lực</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">feel constant pressure</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) phải </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">n&acirc;ng cấp những thứ họ đang c&oacute;</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">upgrade their possessions</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LCB2dAf7eokNFcxh1mdl7fkIgGe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Impact: </strong>điều n&agrave;y tạo ra một <em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">tư duy vật chất kh&ocirc;ng l&agrave;nh mạnh</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">unhealthy materialistic mindset</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">), khi con người </span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; gi&aacute; trị bản th&acirc;n</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> (</span><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">measure their worth</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">) th&ocirc;ng qua việc sở hữu những sản phẩm mới nhất.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gi1jdfH3YoORBvxfgNplATH6gxe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-BHVjdZmI0oMKnrxn4CtlTdn5gUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5. Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zu8ndrXoDo0OKIxJZtgljemhguh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XwUKdlE7GoKaOUxsiTll1PW1gse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LTLKdZTkfo3cpoxrKb8l1A9Tgvd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SgQYdQbUhoLYpDxQJU9lauFJgwf\">emphasize novelty <em>(nhấn mạnh sự mởi mẻ)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QUuPdmWdNoIttFxs2VFl3cy9gvd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LD10dnGpdoNgOJxeurnlqgJsgSc\">maintain competitiveness <em>(duy tr&igrave; khả năng cạnh tranh)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AJryd3ivsos0syxPrXolPhGcgpb\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fok4dIj2SoeviaxXaBmldxvHgBb\">foster misleading practices <em>(th&uacute;c đẩy những c&aacute;ch l&agrave;m g&acirc;y hiểu lầm)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-La8YdvL4moniHixSUdQlQgWYgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">create unhealthy shopping habits (<em>tạo th&oacute;i quen mua sắm kh&ocirc;ng l&agrave;nh mạnh</em>)</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 809,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U9Rid3bZBoI7OWxcvsblu2l4gHd\">In recent years, businesses have increasingly promoted their products by emphasizing that they are new or improved in some way in their advertising campaigns. This trend can be attributed to several key factors, and I believe it has created more negative than positive impacts on consumer behavior.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 810,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HIHDdGhnmokdewxoFucl7me8gwD\">There are two main reasons why companies highlight innovation in their marketing strategies. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">Firstly, they understand that humans naturally crave novelty as people tend to desire the latest items and fear missing out on new trends. This is evidenced by how consumers eagerly await new phone releases each year, despite only minor changes in features</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">In addition, in today's competitive marketplace where many companies sell similar things, businesses must find ways to differentiate themselves from competitors. As a result, with many similar choices available, companies often label their products as \"new and improved\" to stand out from rivals</span>.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 811,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENC9dmBRuoYKM5xTsRqlI87Mgqh\">However, this focus on newness in advertising has led to concerning consequences in terms of misleading advertising practices and excessive consumerism. <span style=\"color: rgb(186, 55, 42);\">With regard to the former, many advertisements exaggerate minor improvements as revolutionary breakthroughs, such as promoting a \"new formula\" that has minimal actual changes. This practice gradually erodes consumer trust in marketing claims</span>. <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, when advertisements make every new feature seem necessary, consumers feel constant pressure to upgrade their possessions. This creates an unhealthy materialistic mindset where people measure their worth through owning the latest products</span>.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 812,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CJiHdNAhFonyIkxK2dll0QoWgNc\">In conclusion, while businesses emphasize novelty to appeal to human psychology and maintain competitiveness, this advertising approach has ultimately fostered misleading practices and created unhealthy shopping habits among consumers.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14295,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
